PanVK/panfrost on Mali-G78 (Pixel gs101) and Mali-G77 (Oneplus) bonus!
Apply each directory in order with patch -p1.

kernel/  (Linux 7.2, drivers/gpu/drm/panfrost)
  0001  Mali-G78 (0x9202, masked 0x9002), errata from Arm tBEx
  0002  Mali-G77 (0x9000), errata from Arm tTRx (r0p0, r0p1) The Oneplus bonus

patches/ (Mesa, base: upstream dc330577adb9e98363ef6061e09062f171d0d053, 26.3.0_git20260825)
  0001  Mali-G78 in the panfrost model table
  0002  Mali-G77 (0x9000) in the panfrost model table Bonus
  0003  Disable transaction elimination on G78
  0004  PanVK: Valhall v9 on the JM backend, compute only (no graphics yet) (G78 + G77)


good luck
